.TH batten-perf-gate 1  batten 
.SH NAME
batten\-perf\-gate \- Measure this branch against its merge base and refuse a regression
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBbatten perf gate\fR [\fB\-\-null\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Measure this branch against its merge base and refuse a regression
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-null\fR
Measure HEAD against itself, so the ratio is the noise floor rather than a comparison
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
